WEBVTT

00:23.370 --> 00:26.880
<b>Art Room</b>

00:25.710 --> 00:31.670
Today, I'll have you pair up and 
draw portraits of each other.

00:39.680 --> 00:44.190
So, um, I forgot my glasses today.

00:46.040 --> 00:48.470
But I'm going to do my best.

00:48.470 --> 00:49.440
Yeah.

00:49.910 --> 00:55.380
<i>I'm gonna end up appreciating 
anything she draws.</i>

00:55.380 --> 00:57.450
<i>I'd buy it and put it up on my front door.</i>

00:58.300 --> 01:01.450
<i>I need to draw Mie-san well, too.</i>

01:07.940 --> 01:09.700
<i>I saw this coming.</i>

01:09.700 --> 01:11.380
<i>I saw this coming, but...</i>

01:11.750 --> 01:15.170
I can't look at you when I'm drawing,
and I can't draw you when I'm looking.

01:15.170 --> 01:16.380
<i>A dilemma.</i>

01:17.230 --> 01:18.310
Um...

01:18.310 --> 01:20.390
Can I draw you as I imagine you?

01:20.700 --> 01:24.330
Like, how I think of you in my head?

01:27.210 --> 01:30.510
<i>How Mie-san imagines me in her head...</i>

01:44.720 --> 01:46.250
I'm putting it up on my front door.

01:47.590 --> 01:50.000
I'm going to be collecting them.

01:57.760 --> 01:58.840
The Girl I Like 
her Glasses

01:58.840 --> 02:01.850
The Girl I Like 
Forgot her Glasses

03:21.800 --> 03:26.850
Episode 7

03:21.800 --> 03:26.850
I Brought Home

03:21.800 --> 03:26.850
The Girl I Like's Glasses

03:28.310 --> 03:30.270
Hey, it's Mie-san.

03:32.760 --> 03:34.060
Morning.

03:35.650 --> 03:36.550
Umm...

03:36.550 --> 03:38.360
Someya-san, is that you?

03:38.360 --> 03:40.300
Sorry, I forgot my glasses.

03:40.300 --> 03:41.650
I can't really see you.

03:43.430 --> 03:44.280
That's right.

03:44.280 --> 03:45.200
It's Someya.

03:46.150 --> 03:48.230
We have math first today.

03:48.230 --> 03:49.600
What a pain.

03:49.600 --> 03:51.210
It sucks.

03:52.790 --> 03:54.330
What's up?

03:54.330 --> 03:56.330
You know, Mie-san...

03:56.330 --> 03:57.800
You have really long eyelashes.

03:57.800 --> 03:59.710
Are you using extensions?

03:59.960 --> 04:02.280
I-I'm not.

04:02.280 --> 04:03.690
So lucky!

04:03.690 --> 04:05.220
Your skin's so nice, too.

04:05.620 --> 04:07.120
Err...

04:07.120 --> 04:08.930
Could you not look so much?

04:08.930 --> 04:09.500
No?

04:09.500 --> 04:11.540
It's okay, but...

04:13.250 --> 04:14.470
See you.

04:25.530 --> 04:27.530
<b>Class 3-B</b>

04:29.720 --> 04:30.750
Mie-san.

04:30.750 --> 04:31.540
Morning.

04:35.260 --> 04:36.580
Komura-kun?

04:36.580 --> 04:38.270
Y-Yeah, Komura-kun.

04:39.750 --> 04:41.170
<i>Here she goes again!</i>

04:41.170 --> 04:42.340
It's Komura-kun.

04:42.340 --> 04:43.260
Morning.

04:47.700 --> 04:49.620
Uh, err...

04:50.210 --> 04:51.350
Sorry.

04:53.900 --> 05:00.860
Mie-san was 
getting up 
close to him 
again within
a few days.

04:54.670 --> 05:00.860
<i>Mie-san was getting up close 
to him again within a few days.</i>

05:18.010 --> 05:21.130
<i>I brought Mie-san home!</i>

05:21.750 --> 05:24.210
<i>No, it's not Mie-san.</i>

05:24.210 --> 05:25.800
<i>It's not Mie-san, but...</i>

05:26.150 --> 05:28.300
<i>It's essentially Mie-san.</i>

05:29.640 --> 05:31.550
<i>Essentially Mie-san!</i>

05:34.360 --> 05:37.780
<b>30
minutes
earlier...</b>

05:34.500 --> 05:36.470
<i>Thirty minutes earlier...</i>

05:43.090 --> 05:45.440
Mie-chan, let's walk home together.

05:45.440 --> 05:47.560
Don't you have a club meet?

05:47.560 --> 05:48.900
Not today.

05:48.900 --> 05:50.090
Okay.

05:50.090 --> 05:52.110
Just a second.

05:55.000 --> 05:56.730
You look sleepy.

05:56.730 --> 05:59.380
It was warm today.

06:02.810 --> 06:04.270
Thanks, Komura.

06:04.270 --> 06:07.130
Nah, it was just a few notebooks to carry.

06:07.690 --> 06:09.030
Get home safe.

06:09.030 --> 06:10.030
Yes, sir.

06:24.970 --> 06:26.670
<i>Her bag isn't here...</i>

06:26.670 --> 06:27.630
<i>Has she already left?</i>

06:28.690 --> 06:31.310
<i>So she forgot her glasses?</i>

06:32.820 --> 06:35.240
<i>Should I just leave them here?</i>

06:35.240 --> 06:37.400
<i>Maybe I should at least 
put them in her desk?</i>

06:37.400 --> 06:40.420
<i>No, I shouldn't touch them 
without permission...</i>

06:51.380 --> 06:52.000
<i>Oh.</i>

06:52.460 --> 06:56.430
<i>Right, I have Mie-san on LIME.</i>

07:01.150 --> 07:02.940
"You forgot your glasses in class."

07:02.940 --> 07:03.770
"What should I do?"

07:06.780 --> 07:08.440
"Oh, that's right."

07:08.440 --> 07:10.840
"I actually wore them today."

07:10.840 --> 07:13.280
"Sorry, you can leave them there."

07:14.680 --> 07:17.820
<i>Is it really safe to leave them here?</i>

07:18.290 --> 07:20.840
<i>It's the weekend starting tomorrow.</i>

07:20.840 --> 07:22.790
<i>What if they break?</i>

07:26.620 --> 07:29.190
"I'm worried about leaving 
them here over the weekend."

07:29.890 --> 07:31.650
"Should I take them home?"

07:36.700 --> 07:39.020
"Really? That'd be a relief."

07:39.020 --> 07:40.760
"Could you take them home, then?"

07:40.760 --> 07:41.810
"Thanks."

07:44.810 --> 07:48.030
<i>I've done it now!</i>

07:48.030 --> 07:54.500
<i>I-Isn't there something pervy about 
bringing home Mie-san's glasses?</i>

07:54.500 --> 07:57.600
<i>I didn't want to just leave 
them there in class, though...</i>

07:58.330 --> 07:59.990
<i>Yeah, it's fine!</i>

07:59.990 --> 08:02.350
<i>There's nothing to be ashamed of.</i>

08:02.350 --> 08:04.120
<i>I can hold my head high.</i>

08:05.130 --> 08:06.880
Welcome home, Kaede.

08:08.600 --> 08:10.500
I-I'm home.

08:10.500 --> 08:12.050
What? What's wrong?

08:12.610 --> 08:14.420
Eh? About what?

08:14.420 --> 08:15.840
What do you mean, "what?"

08:16.880 --> 08:19.900
I-I'm going to be in my room for a while.

08:20.900 --> 08:23.350
Must be puberty.

08:31.450 --> 08:35.470
<i>I don't want them to get 
crushed in my bag or anything.</i>

08:50.420 --> 08:52.040
It's me, Mie.

08:57.050 --> 08:59.150
It's me, Mie.

09:04.390 --> 09:06.550
<i>I can't focus!</i>

09:06.550 --> 09:08.400
<i>They're distracting!</i>

09:09.050 --> 09:11.960
<i>This is what it's actually like!</i>

09:11.960 --> 09:13.900
It's me, Mie.

09:13.900 --> 09:17.410
<i>It's actually like this!</i>

09:24.740 --> 09:27.140
<i>I'll have her face the other way.</i>

09:30.840 --> 09:32.810
<i>Carefully...</i>

09:47.690 --> 09:49.270
<i>Damn it, me!</i>

09:49.270 --> 09:50.860
<i>What the hell are you doing?!</i>

09:50.860 --> 09:53.420
<i>What's gotten into you?!</i>

09:54.750 --> 09:57.260
<i>I feel like I've tarnished them.</i>

09:57.260 --> 09:59.320
<i>I've tarnished Mie-san's glasses!</i>

10:05.080 --> 10:06.590
<b>Backup Glasses</b>

10:29.250 --> 10:35.480
<i>I hope the glasses I left with Komura-kun 
don't have my fingerprints on them or anything.</i>

10:45.380 --> 10:47.680
<i>They're clean now...</i>

10:47.680 --> 10:51.500
<i>But I wiped Mie-san's 
glasses without asking her.</i>

10:51.880 --> 10:53.580
<i>Calm down!</i>

10:53.580 --> 10:56.510
<i>Why am I being so weird about this?</i>

10:56.510 --> 11:01.510
<i>It's true that this is Mie-san's, 
but it's just a pair of glasses.</i>

11:01.970 --> 11:03.010
<i>Yeah.</i>

11:03.010 --> 11:05.000
<i>There's nothing to get so awkward about.</i>

11:05.000 --> 11:06.880
<i>I just gotta live my life like normal.</i>

11:08.850 --> 11:09.870
<i>A call?</i>

11:10.930 --> 11:12.020
<i>Who's it from?</i>

11:15.110 --> 11:17.610
Mie-san
 LIME Audio

11:22.280 --> 11:23.620
Hello?

11:24.130 --> 11:25.620
<i>Komura-kun?</i>

11:25.620 --> 11:27.700
Mie-san's voice!

11:27.970 --> 11:29.150
Good evening.

11:29.580 --> 11:30.940
<i>Good evening.</i>

11:30.940 --> 11:33.670
Thanks for taking care of my glasses.

11:34.580 --> 11:37.380
Are my glasses being a good boy?

11:37.380 --> 11:38.340
<i>A good boy?!</i>

11:39.500 --> 11:41.970
I-I think so.

11:42.400 --> 11:44.290
Um, hey...

11:44.920 --> 11:47.430
Were they dirty or anything?

11:47.950 --> 11:50.890
<i>Nah, I guess you wouldn't have 
looked at them that closely.</i>

11:50.890 --> 11:53.000
<i>Sorry, that was a weird thing to ask.</i>

11:54.440 --> 11:57.400
I suddenly started feeling 
self-conscious about it.

11:57.400 --> 12:00.940
<i>Not only did I get a good 
look, I wiped them clean.</i>

12:01.430 --> 12:07.660
Though, my glasses are at your place, huh?

12:09.300 --> 12:14.030
It's kinda like I'm visiting your place.

12:20.210 --> 12:21.580
It's me, Mie.

12:23.190 --> 12:25.430
Thanks for having me over.

12:26.020 --> 12:27.530
<i>Just kidding.</i>

12:27.530 --> 12:28.850
It's me, Mie.

12:30.330 --> 12:32.850
<i>Well, see you on Monday.</i>

12:43.380 --> 12:44.970
It's me, Mie.

12:49.910 --> 12:50.910
It's me, Mie.

13:06.690 --> 13:10.930
<i>After she said all that...</i>

13:11.430 --> 13:15.180
<i>How am I supposed to not think about it?</i>

13:15.180 --> 13:16.520
It's me, Mie.

13:17.440 --> 13:23.950
Komura
had a
sleepless
weekend.

13:18.650 --> 13:22.770
<i>Komura had a sleepless weekend.</i>

13:36.120 --> 13:38.630
<b>Class 3-B</b>

13:44.020 --> 13:45.730
<i>She's forgotten her glasses.</i>

13:47.810 --> 13:49.540
Morning, Mie-san.

13:49.540 --> 13:51.300
Morning, Komura-kun.

13:53.680 --> 13:58.520
<i>I feel like she gets up close to 
me for no real reason these days.</i>

13:59.120 --> 14:00.590
<i>I guess it's a habit.</i>

14:18.200 --> 14:19.750
S-Sorry.

14:23.370 --> 14:25.280
I leaned too far forward.

14:25.280 --> 14:26.180
<i>Thank you!</i>

14:26.180 --> 14:27.170
<i>For leaning forward!</i>

14:28.130 --> 14:30.100
I should be careful.

14:30.100 --> 14:34.470
One time, I bumped foreheads with 
someone when I leaned in.

14:35.000 --> 14:36.470
I can picture that.

14:37.600 --> 14:41.960
Another time, I got so close 
that our lips touched.

14:52.490 --> 14:55.300
No, it was with Dad!

14:55.300 --> 14:57.500
Huh? Ah.

14:57.500 --> 15:01.440
<i>I think she noticed me getting 
completely flustered.</i>

15:01.440 --> 15:04.380
<i>I'm totally showing my 
feelings towards her!</i>

15:04.750 --> 15:06.750
That was when I was a kid.

15:06.750 --> 15:08.490
It hasn't happened since, okay?

15:08.490 --> 15:09.760
Y-Yeah.

15:10.180 --> 15:11.210
So, um...

15:11.210 --> 15:13.760
Please don't think I'm a bad girl.

15:21.820 --> 15:25.360
<i>Is it just me, or is Mie-san flustered, too?</i>

15:26.550 --> 15:30.380
<i>Nah, I'm sure she didn't 
really mean anything by it.</i>

15:32.320 --> 15:33.260
<i>Yeah.</i>

15:33.260 --> 15:34.430
<i>She meant nothing.</i>

15:50.120 --> 15:52.320
Mie-chan, you've got bed head.

15:52.860 --> 15:53.800
Really? Where?

15:54.200 --> 15:55.390
Here, see?

15:56.100 --> 15:57.310
<i>She does!</i>

15:57.780 --> 15:59.030
Huh?

15:59.030 --> 16:01.810
I can't tell. I don't have my glasses.

16:02.320 --> 16:05.070
I need to see it in the big 
mirror in the washroom.

16:05.070 --> 16:07.110
Class is about to start.

16:09.130 --> 16:11.190
Don't worry. It doesn't look weird.

16:11.190 --> 16:12.800
It's actually cute.

16:12.800 --> 16:14.270
Lies.

16:14.270 --> 16:15.820
I'm serious.

16:15.820 --> 16:17.620
<i>It's really bothering her.</i>

16:17.620 --> 16:19.280
<i>It's all right, Mie-san!</i>

16:19.280 --> 16:20.550
<i>It's not weird!</i>

16:20.550 --> 16:22.030
<i>It's actually cute!</i>

16:22.030 --> 16:22.620
<i>Seriously!</i>

16:24.310 --> 16:26.800
<i>That said, I'm sure it bugs her.</i>

16:28.050 --> 16:34.000
<i>So long as she can't see it herself, 
nothing anyone says is going to help.</i>

16:34.000 --> 16:35.180
Komura-kun.

16:37.250 --> 16:38.210
What's up?

16:38.760 --> 16:42.140
Err, is my hair weird at all?

16:51.110 --> 16:53.120
N-No, it's fine.

16:53.120 --> 16:54.470
Really?

16:54.470 --> 16:55.660
Totally.

16:56.600 --> 16:57.900
For sure?

16:57.900 --> 16:58.870
Yeah.

17:00.570 --> 17:01.950
It's okay, then.

17:01.950 --> 17:03.370
Thanks.

17:04.430 --> 17:06.520
All right, let's get started.

17:06.520 --> 17:07.880
Okay.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.130
What's wrong?

17:34.130 --> 17:35.590
Oh...

17:36.160 --> 17:37.910
My shoulder hurts a bit.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.940
Hey, Komura-kun...

17:48.920 --> 17:53.020
Dad says I'm good at giving shoulder rubs.

17:53.020 --> 17:54.550
I-I see.

17:57.340 --> 17:59.510
N-No, it's fine.

17:59.510 --> 18:01.050
I'm good.

18:01.370 --> 18:02.280
Why?

18:02.280 --> 18:03.820
I'm actually good.

18:03.820 --> 18:06.060
Mom even says so, too.

18:06.060 --> 18:08.280
No, I'm good. I'm fine.

18:08.280 --> 18:12.630
<i>Mie-san's hands would be 
touching my shoulders!</i>

18:12.630 --> 18:16.580
<i>I don't know what that'll do to me!</i>

18:17.080 --> 18:18.570
It won't hurt.

18:23.180 --> 18:25.580
Pardon me.

18:29.500 --> 18:30.500
<i>Embrace nothingness.</i>

18:30.500 --> 18:31.310
<i>Become nothing.</i>

18:31.310 --> 18:33.090
<i>Clear your mind.</i>

18:35.780 --> 18:37.990
How is it, Grandpa?

18:37.990 --> 18:39.580
It's nice.

18:40.180 --> 18:42.250
<i>Please stop having fun behind me!</i>

18:42.250 --> 18:43.390
<i>I can't clear my mind!</i>

18:45.630 --> 18:47.600
<i>She really is good.</i>

18:48.410 --> 18:51.600
I can do this with my eyes closed.

18:51.600 --> 18:54.460
<i>I can picture her flexing behind me.</i>

18:56.610 --> 18:57.720
Thanks.

18:58.900 --> 19:00.540
You're welcome.

19:09.270 --> 19:12.080
"Shoulder rubs."

19:13.780 --> 19:15.200
What're you doing?

19:15.200 --> 19:17.300
I thought I'd keep a note.

19:17.980 --> 19:22.050
Of what I can do for you even 
when I don't have my glasses.

19:24.430 --> 19:27.060
You're always doing things for me.

19:31.040 --> 19:35.060
Oh, I'll do anything when I'm 
actually wearing my glasses.

19:36.750 --> 19:40.530
<i>I wish she'd write "Be by his side."</i>

20:06.200 --> 20:09.930
Komura-kun, sixth period is about to start.

21:05.590 --> 21:08.480
Er, I didn't forget my glasses today,

21:08.480 --> 21:12.860
so I thought I'd take the opportunity 
to get a good look at you...

21:17.020 --> 21:18.670
Why...

21:18.960 --> 21:20.400
S-Sorry!

21:21.250 --> 21:23.050
No, it's fine.

21:23.780 --> 21:24.920
It's fine.

21:25.650 --> 21:29.690
In that case...

21:34.320 --> 21:36.190
You can get a good look at me, too.

21:36.190 --> 21:39.050
No, I'll pass!

21:39.050 --> 21:39.940
That's too far!

23:10.980 --> 23:12.120
Komura Kaede here.

23:12.120 --> 23:13.830
I'm about to do the episode preview.

23:13.830 --> 23:18.040
It's a bit late, but I wonder if it would 
have been better if Azuma-kun did these previews.

23:18.040 --> 23:20.600
He's good-looking and good at talking.

23:21.820 --> 23:26.800
"Komura-kun passes by Azuma-kun 
as he is being confessed to.

23:26.800 --> 23:29.560
Mie-san also comes by, and..."

23:29.560 --> 23:30.550
Azuma-kun?!

23:30.550 --> 23:31.800
Mie-san, too?!

23:31.800 --> 23:33.360
What's going on?!

23:33.360 --> 23:33.970
Next episode:

23:33.970 --> 23:36.720
"The Girl I Like and I 
Saw A Confession Together."

23:33.970 --> 23:39.900
Episode 8

23:33.970 --> 23:39.900
The Girl I Like and I

23:33.970 --> 23:39.900
Saw A Confession Together

23:37.100 --> 23:38.990
Is that even a thing?!
